{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"variable-flexrender","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Variable: FlexRender"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const FlexRender: DefineComponent<{\n  cell?: FlexRenderCell;\n  footer?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  header?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  props?: any;\n  render?: any;\n}, () => any, {\n}, {\n}, {\n}, ComponentOptionsMixin, ComponentOptionsMixin, {\n}, string, PublicProps, ToResolvedProps<{\n  cell?: FlexRenderCell;\n  footer?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  header?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  props?: any;\n  render?: any;\n}, {\n}>, {\n  cell: FlexRenderCell;\n  footer: FlexRenderHeader;\n  header: FlexRenderHeader;\n  props: any;\n  render: any;\n}, {\n}, {\n}, {\n}, string, ComponentProvideOptions, true, {\n}, any>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/FlexRender.ts#L75","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/vue-table/src/FlexRender.ts:75"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Simplified component for rendering headers, cells, or footers."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Supports both the new shorthand pattern and the legacy "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":":render"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":":props"},{"type":"text","value":" pattern:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<!-- New shorthand pattern -->\n<FlexRender :cell=\"cell\" />\n<FlexRender :header=\"header\" />\n<FlexRender :footer=\"header\" />\n\n<!-- Legacy pattern (still supported) -->\n<FlexRender :render=\"cell.column.columnDef.cell\" :props=\"cell.getContext()\" />","lang":"vue"}],"headings":[{"id":"variable-flexrender","text":"Variable: FlexRender","level":1},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Variable: FlexRender\n\n```ts\nconst FlexRender: DefineComponent<{\n  cell?: FlexRenderCell;\n  footer?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  header?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  props?: any;\n  render?: any;\n}, () => any, {\n}, {\n}, {\n}, ComponentOptionsMixin, ComponentOptionsMixin, {\n}, string, PublicProps, ToResolvedProps<{\n  cell?: FlexRenderCell;\n  footer?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  header?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  props?: any;\n  render?: any;\n}, {\n}>, {\n  cell: FlexRenderCell;\n  footer: FlexRenderHeader;\n  header: FlexRenderHeader;\n  props: any;\n  render: any;\n}, {\n}, {\n}, {\n}, string, ComponentProvideOptions, true, {\n}, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/FlexRender.ts:75](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/FlexRender.ts#L75)\n\nSimplified component for rendering headers, cells, or footers.\n\nSupports both the new shorthand pattern and the legacy `:render`/`:props` pattern:\n\n## Example\n\n```vue\n<!-- New shorthand pattern -->\n<FlexRender :cell=\"cell\" />\n<FlexRender :header=\"header\" />\n<FlexRender :footer=\"header\" />\n\n<!-- Legacy pattern (still supported) -->\n<FlexRender :render=\"cell.column.columnDef.cell\" :props=\"cell.getContext()\" />\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FlexRender\ntitle: FlexRender\n---\n\n# Variable: FlexRender\n\n```ts\nconst FlexRender: DefineComponent<{\n  cell?: FlexRenderCell;\n  footer?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  header?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  props?: any;\n  render?: any;\n}, () => any, {\n}, {\n}, {\n}, ComponentOptionsMixin, ComponentOptionsMixin, {\n}, string, PublicProps, ToResolvedProps<{\n  cell?: FlexRenderCell;\n  footer?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  header?: FlexRenderHeader;\n  props?: any;\n  render?: any;\n}, {\n}>, {\n  cell: FlexRenderCell;\n  footer: FlexRenderHeader;\n  header: FlexRenderHeader;\n  props: any;\n  render: any;\n}, {\n}, {\n}, {\n}, string, ComponentProvideOptions, true, {\n}, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/FlexRender.ts:75](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/FlexRender.ts#L75)\n\nSimplified component for rendering headers, cells, or footers.\n\nSupports both the new shorthand pattern and the legacy `:render`/`:props` pattern:\n\n## Example\n\n```vue\n<!-- New shorthand pattern -->\n<FlexRender :cell=\"cell\" />\n<FlexRender :header=\"header\" />\n<FlexRender :footer=\"header\" />\n\n<!-- Legacy pattern (still supported) -->\n<FlexRender :render=\"cell.column.columnDef.cell\" :props=\"cell.getContext()\" />\n```\n"}
